WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.866
"Oh my!" cried Mole.

2
00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:20.827
"Shh," said Rat gently.

3
00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:25.609
A very strange sight appeared before them.

4
00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.536
It was a strange creature.

5
00:00:28.537 --> 00:00:33.487
He had the legs of a goat and the body of a man.

6
00:00:33.488 --> 00:00:37.480
The horns on his head shone in the dawn.

7
00:00:37.481 --> 00:00:41.667
His kind face had a soft beard.

8
00:00:41.668 --> 00:00:47.528
"Rat, are you still afraid?" asked Mole.

9
00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:49.834
"No," said Rat.

10
00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:55.305
"And yes. He looks as strong as a thunderstorm."

11
00:00:55.306 --> 00:01:00.618
"But as gentle as a summer breeze," said Mole.

12
00:01:00.619 --> 00:01:03.180
"Look," said Rat.

13
00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:06.009
"He is holding pipes."

14
00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:09.691
"The music!" said Mole quietly.

15
00:01:09.692 --> 00:01:13.615
The kind face smiled at them.

16
00:01:13.616 --> 00:01:18.951
"I think," said Rat, "he is a friend."

17
00:01:18.952 --> 00:01:24.342
The dawn glowed, and a warm breeze touched them.

18
00:01:24.343 --> 00:01:27.891
Then the two animals were alone.

19
00:01:27.892 --> 00:01:32.420
For a moment they felt very sad.

20
00:01:32.421 --> 00:01:36.411
"What did you say, Rat?" asked Mole.

21
00:01:36.412 --> 00:01:38.617
He rubbed his eyes.

22
00:01:38.618 --> 00:01:41.807
"I was just thinking," said Rat.

23
00:01:41.808 --> 00:01:44.880
"Portly might be around here."

24
00:01:44.881 --> 00:01:47.382
"Look!" said Mole.

25
00:01:47.383 --> 00:01:48.870
"There he is!"

26
00:01:48.871 --> 00:01:52.404
Portly woke with a squeak of joy.

27
00:01:52.405 --> 00:01:57.537
"Rat! Mole!" cried the little otter.

28
00:01:57.538 --> 00:02:00.549
"You found me!"

29
00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:04.014
Portly jumped into Mole's arms.

30
00:02:04.015 --> 00:02:08.887
But Rat stared at hoof marks in the sand.

31
00:02:08.888 --> 00:02:13.545
"Some . . . big . . . animal was here," said Rat.

32
00:02:13.546 --> 00:02:19.885
He tried to remember something, but couldn't.
